   "line": "Three gunners. Red laser on you means a shot's coming, so move. And if it gets busy, click the mouse wheel. Slows everything down for a few seconds.",
   "on": "objective:1"
  },
  {
   "who": "host",
   "line": "Oh, he shoots too! Echo, sweetheart, you never told me that.",
   "on": "done:1"
